id: multi-storage
name: Multi-Storage
kind: crafting
types: physical
slots: 1
requiresQualities: throwing-weapon
excludesQualities: boomerang
prerequisites: Throwing Weapon, this Weapon does not have the Boomerang Weapon Quality
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Thrown, a copy goes and it stays in hand - three Throws a Combat Round.
# What it does, for the Effects on its Item's sheet: its Effects line as printed, word for
# word, cut into one line to an effect, each opening with its tag as the rulebook writes one.
summary: >
  [Passive]: If you use the Throw Maneuver for this Weapon, instead of throwing this Weapon, use
  a copy of this Weapon instead. That copy of this Weapon ceases to exist after you complete the
  Throw Maneuver. You may use the Throw Maneuver to throw this Weapon up to 3 times per Combat
  Round, instead of the usual 1/Round limitation for the Throw Maneuver.
text: >
  Multi-Storage: You possess a near infinite number of copies of this Weapon.
  –Weapon Type: Physical
  –Prerequisites: Throwing Weapon, this Weapon does not have the Boomerang Weapon Quality
  –Quality Slots: 1
  –Effects: If you use the Throw Maneuver for this Weapon, instead of throwing this Weapon, use
  a copy of this Weapon instead. That copy of this Weapon ceases to exist after you complete the
  Throw Maneuver. You may use the Throw Maneuver to throw this Weapon up to 3 times per Combat
  Round, instead of the usual 1/Round limitation for the Throw Maneuver.

---

# Three Throws a Combat Round in all, by the table's ruling - an ordinary one among them - and the
# Weapon stays in hand.
[passive]
weapon.copies = true;
